  "wholeSourceFunctionalReview": [
    "Existing exact EEC public model/store and optional SourceRevisionID preserve current two-argument construction; schema version stays 1. Full file/revision resolver is not supplied by this lane.",
    "Move updates integral sequence-frame start; Slip preserves duration/start and changes source range; narrow non-ripple Trim preserves source mapping and rejects range extension. Each validates and advances revision once.",
    "CAS Save keeps project identity/schema/sequential stored revision, exclusive lock, fresh same-directory temporary file, Flush(true), atomic replacement and own temporary cleanup. No crash-durability guarantee beyond existing owner implementation is inferred.",
    "Overflow guards cover timeline/source extents and stable identities; canonical original whole Run checks actual real local create/insert/split/save/open/refusal and new timeline edits with stale/overflow/range refusal bytes conserved.",
    "Native Program/project unchanged. Broad native Core/Infrastructure/CUI AI graph remains separate; no native renderer/media/GES/GStreamer/proxy/export/Home/Files actor bootstrap imported.",
    "Helper checks actual exact head and clean tracked source, immutable eight-row ledger/Commands before build, normal SDK restore/build to fresh output, evaluated target and apphost, genuine original Run result and source/custody after. No imported DLLs or alternate oracle."
  ],
